{
  "//": [
    "astrodark theme, derived",
    "legend: <palette key>: <roles>",
    "ui.accent: model (bold), thinking-effort",
    "syntax.orange: context-length, context-percentage, compaction-counter (dim)",
    "syntax.cyan: tokens-*",
    "syntax.cyan x0.75 (#38928A): cache-*",
    "syntax.purple: session-usage, reset-timer, weekly-usage, weekly-reset-timer",
    "syntax.green: git-branch, worktree-branch",
    "syntax.green x0.75 (#659047): current-working-dir",
    "syntax.yellow: git-changes (as p10k clean/modified)",
    "syntax.text: battery (custom-command pmset), clock (custom-command date)",
    "syntax.mute: line 1 separators (incl. |), line 3 separators",
    "ui.border: line 3 dir separator",
    "notes: line 2 separators (incl. |) have no colour",
    "notes: format hex:RRGGBB, needs colorLevel 3",
    "notes: one hue per group, never shared; syntax.red only for errors/warnings; a label takes its value's colour (widgets cannot colour by threshold)",
    "notes: x0.75 = each RGB channel x0.75, rounded; re-derive from the new base hex",
    "notes: tokens-cached and cache-hit-rate labels: Nerd Font bolt U+F0E7 (JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono) plus a trailing space, so it clears the value"
  ],
